    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Borora Cottage is a stunning home set on extensive grounds with a paddock, stables and sand arena, whilst the owner has maintained its old world character this property still includes all modern requirements such as a good specification along with an attractive open plan layout. \r\n\r\nThe owners at Borora Cottage significantly refurbished and extended this home over the last 15 years therefore allowing an incoming purchaser to immediately enjoy a good layout with plenty of character and unique features therefore no additional expenditure is required. The property is set at the edge of Carlanstown Village adjoining Carlanstown Cross Country and it simply needs to be viewed so as to be appreciated.\r\n\r\nTo start with the inside of the cottage, it is presented with a fully fitted modern kitchen and open plan dining and sitting area with an attractive raised feature ceiling. The main hallway offers access to two double bedrooms and at the rear of the property is a further two bedrooms, an ensuite, walk in wardrobe and a main bathroom. \r\n\r\nAt the rear of the cottage is a back garden, separate stables, a sand arena and paddock which overlooks onto Carlanstown Cross Country. Located at Carlanstown Village this home is only 4 minutes from Kells town centre, 5 minutes from the M3 Motorway, 20 minutes to Navan and 45 minutes to Blanchardstown.\r\n\r\nViewings are by appointment and are a necessity in order to appreciate this beautiful home and its potential."
      },
